{"ref":"BDB, נוּן²","hw":"נוּן²","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">נוּן</span></big>  and (<a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 7:27\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.7.27\">1 Ch 7:27</a>) <span dir=\"rtl\">נוֹן</span> <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> father of Joshua <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 7:27\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.7.27\">1 Ch 7:27</a>; elsewhere always <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּן־נוּן(יְהוֹשֻׁעַ)</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 33:11\" href=\"/Exodus.33.11\">Ex 33:11</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 11:28\" href=\"/Numbers.11.28\">Nu 11:28</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 13:8\" href=\"/Numbers.13.8\">13:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 13:16\" href=\"/Numbers.13.16\">16</a> + 22 times Nu Dt Jos (JEDP); also <a data-ref=\"Judges 2:8\" href=\"/Judges.2.8\">Ju 2:8</a> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 16:34\" href=\"/I_Kings.16.34\">1 K 16:34</a> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 8:17\" href=\"/Nehemiah.8.17\">Ne 8:17</a>; 𝔊 Ναυη (for Ναυν by error, cf. Thes).","next":"BDB, נִין","prev":"BDB, נוּן"}